![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

The `buildSemanticKgFullCandidateClassification` function is not fully robust against a `null` or non-object `options` argument. If `options` is explicitly passed as `null`, dereferencing `options.paths` will throw a `TypeError`.

To prevent potential runtime crashes and ensure graceful fail-closed behavior, please guard the `options` parameter and safely default to an empty object if it is not a valid object.

```suggestion
export function buildSemanticKgFullCandidateClassification(options = {}) {
  const opts = isObject(options) ? options : {};
  const root = rootFromOptions(opts);
  const paths = {
    ...DEFAULT_PATHS,
    ...(opts.paths ?? {}),
  };
```

